# Local development, tests, and static builds require no secrets.
# Local deployment uses an Alchemy Cloudflare profile.
# CI requires CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN and CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID as GitHub secrets.
# Enable CI deployment with repository variable ALCHEMY_DEPLOY_ENABLED=true.
# See docs/setup.md; never commit provider credentials.
# A future content publisher will use a single-repository GitHub App.
